{"topicSections":[{"title":"The content bundle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text"],"anchor":"The-content-bundle"},{"title":"Turning the dark off and on","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended"],"anchor":"Turning-the-dark-off-and-on"},{"title":"The daemon","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers"],"anchor":"The-daemon"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The engine’s own darkness is a description problem. A dark room prints “It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pitch black. You can’t see a thing.”, its contents stop being resolvable nouns,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the player is inconvenienced. They can stand there for a hundred turns.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This library supplies the consequence, on the schedule the original used.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark"},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle with no rooms in it — one namespaced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counter, one daemon, two knobs and a text table on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init"},{"text":". Wiring is a single line: list the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance in the game’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"text":" block. It reads ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"player.location.isLit"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already answers the whole question of whether there is light here from anything,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so a host that has declared its dark rooms and a lamp has declared everything","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this needs. The schedule is settled at ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init"},{"text":", and so is the prose — with one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"subject passed at the moment it is spoken: the death line is handed the vehicle","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the player was aboard, because a sentence about being found has to say where.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon counts consecutive turns ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ending"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in darkness, wherever they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spent. Lingering is lethal and movement is not, so a lightless dash toward the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stairs can still work. Any reachable light resets the count to zero. Dark turn 1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints the warning; dark turns 2 through ","type":"text"},{"code":"graceTurns + 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are a silent grace;","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from dark turn "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 2"},{"type":"text","text":" on, every turn rolls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chance(lethality)"},{"type":"text","text":" to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"eaten. The warning turn is always safe, which is the classic fairness contract:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a player who UNDOes a death gets the warning beat back before the dice can turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on them again."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two instances in one game collide on their shared ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"text":" namespace before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timer name matters. One lethal dark per game.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wiring","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Wiring"},{"code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoDangerousDark","","struct Deeps: Game {","    let title = \"Deeps\"","","    let dark = DangerousDark()   \/\/ stock prose, one turn of grace, 50% a turn","","    var content: GameContents { dark }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A game with its own voice for the dark passes its two lines as a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text"},{"type":"text","text":", the way every library that prints takes its table:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let dark = DangerousDark(graceTurns: 1, lethality: 50, text: Prose.grueText)","","static let grueText: DangerousDark.Text = {","    var text = DangerousDark.Text()","    text.warning = Prose.grueWarning","    text.death = Prose.grueDeath","    return text","}()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"death"},{"type":"text","text":" takes a subject where "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"warning"},{"type":"text","text":" does not: the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"vehicle the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player was aboard"}]},{"type":"text","text":", or nothing when they were on their own feet. Write both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"halves with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".naming(orBare:)"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["static let grueDeath = GameText.Line<GameText.Noun?>.naming(","    orBare: \"…the room…\"",") {","    \"…\\($0)…\"","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The death this daemon deals is always the lingering one","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and the line has to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be true of that. The counter cannot reach the dice before the third dark turn, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing it kills was killed on the turn it walked into the dark. Zork draws the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinction with two separate sentences and this is the second of them: "},{"code":"V-WALK","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"gverbs.zil:1578","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") says "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“You have walked into the slavering fangs of a lurking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grue!”"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and fires only on a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"blocked"}]},{"type":"text","text":" move in the dark, which is a branch this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library does not have; "},{"code":"GOTO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"code":":2110-2114","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") names the vehicle you are sitting in,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or says “room”. Both halves are the game’s words — the stock line names no place"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at all, because a library that has not seen the game should not decide what to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"call the place somebody was taken from.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"warning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is said ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"once","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" per turn, through the engine’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"sayOnceThisTurn(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A game that also points ","type":"text"},{"code":"text.pitchBlack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at the same sentence — Zork does,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because there the dark-room line ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the threat — reads it a single time on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn it walks into the dark, whichever speaker got there first. Two different","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sentences are two different sentences, and both print. A warning swallowed for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"repeating the room’s own line is still a warned turn.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Making the dark harmless","anchor":"Making-the-dark-harmless"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a room whose solution is to stand in the dark on purpose, or a scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should not be interrupted, set "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["cryptDoor.after(.close) { dark.suspended = true }","cryptDoor.after(.open) { dark.suspended = false }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not stop the daemon by name."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" It is called "},{"code":"\"grue\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(\"grue\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" freezes the counter at whatever it had reached, so resuming","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can put the player straight onto a dice turn and cost them the warning.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Suspending resets the count on every suspended turn, for exactly that reason, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"draws no randomness while it is set.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Worked example","anchor":"Worked-example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"type":"text","text":" wires this over the engine’s own light mechanics — the brass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lantern is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lightSource"},{"type":"text","text":" on two fuses, and the grue is what makes the fuses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matter. The engine’s side of it (the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dark"},{"type":"text","text":" trait, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lightSource"},{"type":"text","text":", what counts as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"light reaching a room, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"die(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and the resurrection hook) is the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Darkness,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Time, and Death","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" article in the "},{"code":"Gnusto","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" documentation."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness that kills: a warning, a grace period, then dice."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"GnustoDangerousDark","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"GnustoDangerousDark"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"GnustoDangerousDark"},"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"GnustoDangerousDark","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark","url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness that kills: a warning, a grace period, then dice."}]},"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/suspended":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Set while the dark is harmless: the grue idles, draws no randomness,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and — because the count resets on every suspended turn — resuming"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always begins again at the warning."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"suspended"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"suspended","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/suspended"},"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"graceTurns"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"lethality"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"text"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DangerousDark","preciseIdentifier":"s:19GnustoDangerousDark0bC0V"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:19GnustoDangerousDark0bC0V4TextV"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","title":"init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)","url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/init(graceturns:lethality:text:)","abstract":[]},"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/timers":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/timers","role":"symbol","title":"timers","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The grue daemon: each dark turn ticks the counter. The warning prints on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first dark turn; dark turns 2…"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 1"},{"type":"text","text":" are a silent grace;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from dark turn "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 2"},{"type":"text","text":" on, each turn rolls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chance(lethality)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be eaten. Stepping back into the light — or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — resets the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count. Guards before the draw, so a lit turn burns no randomness."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark","role":"symbol","title":"DangerousDark","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness that kills: a warning on the first consecutive turn the player"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends in the dark, a configurable grace period, then death. Add it to a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block; there is nothing else to wire:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DangerousDark","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DangerousDark","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/Text":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/text","role":"symbol","title":"DangerousDark.Text","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dark’s own voice: the two lines the mechanics print. Override"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either at init to re-skin; the bundle stores its table as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"let"},{"type":"text","text":", so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"init is the only chance."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Text"}],"type":"topic"}}}